  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱりここか\r\nあさひ、おはよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ん～～～～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……あ！　プロデューサーさん、おはよっす！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、おはよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ところで、この間から同じ練習をしているようだけど\r\n……大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そうなんすよ！\r\nなんでなんすかね……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "全然、この映像の通りにならないんすよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "映像の通りに……\r\nそれが理由で、そのステップを続けていたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも俺が見る限り\r\nもうほとんどできてると思うけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "でも、完璧に同じではないじゃないっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "どうやったらこんなふうになれるんすかね～……",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……まず、あさひは現状で\r\nかなりよくできていると断ったうえでだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふんふん……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030120"
  },
  {
    "select": "全体の動きを見直そう",
