    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "焦りすぎはよくない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今教えることはできるけど、色々言い過ぎても\r\nよくないからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "え～！　わたし早く知りたいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "voiceKeep": true,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030170"
  },
  {
    "text": "知りたい知りたい知りたい～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ま、まあ落ち着け……\r\nあさひはまだアイドルになったばかりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "焦る気持ちもわかるが、色々と教えすぎると\r\nあさひは無理をしちゃいそうで心配なんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、もう少しゆっくりといこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030180,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……楽しみは後に取っとくってことっすね……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001030190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あはは、ならそういうことにしとくっす\r\nプロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700103/1017001030190"
  },
  {
